WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.119 --> 00:00:16.319
Zella was excited about the new kid in town.

2
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.361
Nothing interesting ever happened in boring Stone Wall.

3
00:00:20.381 --> 00:00:23.461
"Follow me, Loro," she said eagerly.

4
00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.742
"We'll show you our house first."

5
00:00:26.582 --> 00:00:28.343
She headed along a forest trail.

6
00:00:29.023 --> 00:00:32.804
The new boy walked beside her, with Raff and Muncher behind them.

7
00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:35.981
"Do you two spend a lot of time in the forest?"

8
00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:39.822
Loro asked, stopping to watch a rock rat scurry past.

9
00:00:40.882 --> 00:00:44.543
"There must be lots of interesting animal species in here."

10
00:00:44.563 --> 00:00:46.704
"There are."

11
00:00:47.744 --> 00:00:49.905
Raff tugged his hat lower on his head.

12
00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:53.106
"I like to look for animals in the forest."

13
00:00:53.126 --> 00:00:56.067
"He's like Darb that way," Zella said.

14
00:00:56.087 --> 00:00:58.587
"You know, Zann's best friend?"

15
00:00:58.607 --> 00:01:00.968
"Zann and Darb?

16
00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:03.797
The kids who saved Magica from that evil guy?"

17
00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:05.578
Loro sounded interested.

18
00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.980
"Do you know them?"

19
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.181
"I wish!"

20
00:01:11.262 --> 00:01:12.502
Zella's eyes lit up.

21
00:01:12.522 --> 00:01:16.224
"Zann, Darb, Perda, and Gliss are my heroes!"

22
00:01:17.865 --> 00:01:19.286
They stepped out of the forest.

23
00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:23.909
Muncher started eating the sparse weeds growing between some rocks.

24
00:01:24.889 --> 00:01:27.151
Zella noticed Loro watching the donkey.

25
00:01:27.171 --> 00:01:31.566
"That's how he got his name—he likes to munch on everything he sees!

26
00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:34.708
Anyway She looked toward the left.

27
00:01:34.728 --> 00:01:38.890
"This is a nice view, but I wish we could see First City from here.

28
00:01:39.751 --> 00:01:40.992
It's too far away, though."

29
00:01:41.892 --> 00:01:42.693
Raff smiled.

30
00:01:43.754 --> 00:01:47.816
"My sister is obsessed with First City because Zann lives there."

31
00:01:47.836 --> 00:01:51.379
"His friends live in Swamp Bottom," Zella said.

32
00:01:51.399 --> 00:01:53.600
"That's even farther away."

33
00:01:55.662 --> 00:01:58.584
Next Zella and Raff showed Loro their house.

34
00:01:59.612 --> 00:02:01.613
Then they led him to the town square.

35
00:02:02.613 --> 00:02:04.914
Raff pointed to a low, squat building.

36
00:02:04.934 --> 00:02:06.655
"That's our school.

37
00:02:07.355 --> 00:02:10.837
There's just one classroom, since there are only 14 kids in Stone Wall."

38
00:02:11.717 --> 00:02:13.118
Zella smiled at Loro.

39
00:02:13.138 --> 00:02:15.719
"Fifteen, now that you're here."

40
00:02:16.559 --> 00:02:21.301
As they kept walking, Zella pointed out the mayor's house, the theater, and the restaurant.

41
00:02:22.081 --> 00:02:24.302
A very old man was sitting on a bench.

42
00:02:25.643 --> 00:02:28.284
He narrowed his eyes and jerked his head at Loro.

43
00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.321
"Who's that?"

44
00:02:31.502 --> 00:02:35.144
Zella introduced Loro to the old man, whose name was Panno.

45
00:02:35.164 --> 00:02:36.965
"Loro just moved here."

46
00:02:36.985 --> 00:02:42.129
"Interesting." Panno got up and hobbled away.

47
00:02:42.989 --> 00:02:43.790
Loro winced.

48
00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:47.572
"Panno seems friendly," he joked.

49
00:02:47.592 --> 00:02:53.476
"Panno is usually nicer than that," Zella said, surprised by the man's rudeness.

50
00:02:53.496 --> 00:02:55.758
"He must be in a bad mood."

51
00:02:55.778 --> 00:02:59.633
"Panno moved to Magica from another world," Raff said.

52
00:02:59.653 --> 00:03:04.236
"Our mom says his people have the gift of seeing what's in people's hearts."

53
00:03:05.617 --> 00:03:06.398
Zella shrugged.

54
00:03:06.418 --> 00:03:08.119
"I don't believe it.

55
00:03:09.019 --> 00:03:10.040
Nobody can do that."

56
00:03:10.981 --> 00:03:13.403
She was tired of talking about Stone Wall.

57
00:03:13.423 --> 00:03:18.366
"So, Loro, you didn't tell us earlier Where did you move from?

58
00:03:19.587 --> 00:03:20.868
Is it close to First City?"

59
00:03:21.749 --> 00:03:22.750
Loro shook his head.

60
00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:25.772
"I've never been to First City."

61
00:03:27.208 --> 00:03:30.091
Zella often dreamed of visiting Magica's capital.

62
00:03:30.111 --> 00:03:33.433
"I bet it's way more interesting than Stone Wall.

63
00:03:34.194 --> 00:03:36.176
I want to visit the palace and the zoo.

64
00:03:36.976 --> 00:03:38.477
Maybe I'd even get to meet Zann!"

65
00:03:39.318 --> 00:03:40.039
Raff laughed.

66
00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.622
"That's the part you'd like best."

67
00:03:44.783 --> 00:03:45.783
Zella laughed too.

68
00:03:48.406 --> 00:03:52.269
She didn't mind when her brother teased her about being a fan of the kid heroes.

69
00:03:52.289 --> 00:03:55.812
"I wish I had a zap accelerator so I could go there."

70
00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.320
"What's that?"

71
00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:58.261
Loro asked.

72
00:03:58.281 --> 00:04:01.462
"Zann's parents invented it," Raff said.

73
00:04:01.482 --> 00:04:06.464
"It's a magical device that lets you travel long distances on a single zap."

74
00:04:06.484 --> 00:04:10.186
"Maybe someday everybody will have one," Zella said.

75
00:04:10.206 --> 00:04:12.827
"Right now there are only a few.

76
00:04:13.847 --> 00:04:15.808
Zann's friends from Swamp Bottom have one.

77
00:04:16.628 --> 00:04:19.970
The others are being tested by Voids, to see if it helps them get around."

78
00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:24.992
Voids were Magicians who didn't have any natural magic.

79
00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:29.223
There were none in Stone Wall, so Zella had never met one.

80
00:04:29.243 --> 00:04:32.125
"Darb is a Void," Zella said.

81
00:04:32.145 --> 00:04:34.067
"He's really cool.

82
00:04:34.447 --> 00:04:37.070
He knows more about animals than just about anyone."

83
00:04:38.431 --> 00:04:41.073
"Well, you sure know a lot about those kids!"

84
00:04:41.493 --> 00:04:42.674
Loro said, grinning.

85
00:04:42.694 --> 00:04:44.676
"Let's go back into the forest.

86
00:04:45.357 --> 00:04:47.138
I'd love to explore some more."

87
00:04:47.158 --> 00:04:50.301
"We'll show you our favorite spot," Raff said.

88
00:04:51.702 --> 00:04:53.824
Zella knew exactly where her brother meant.

89
00:04:54.828 --> 00:04:58.570
They led their new friend past the clearing where they'd met him and kept walking.

90
00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.631
Soon the trees thinned out again.

91
00:05:01.651 --> 00:05:05.752
"Wow," Loro said when they emerged from the forest.

92
00:05:06.613 --> 00:05:11.915
They were near the edge of another cliff, a rocky outcropping that extended over the valley.

93
00:05:12.775 --> 00:05:16.177
Immediately below was the silvery expanse of Infinity Lake.

94
00:05:16.197 --> 00:05:17.577
"Be careful!"

95
00:05:17.997 --> 00:05:20.398
Zella said as Loro stepped closer to the edge.

96
00:05:21.239 --> 00:05:22.619
He turned around to look at her.

97
00:05:22.639 --> 00:05:24.140
"What's wrong?

98
00:05:25.172 --> 00:05:26.432
Are you afraid of that lake?"

99
00:05:26.452 --> 00:05:29.473
"Zella is afraid of heights," Raff said.

100
00:05:30.934 --> 00:05:31.814
Zella flushed.

101
00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:35.335
"But some people are scared of Infinity Lake.

102
00:05:36.135 --> 00:05:41.257
Anything that touches its waters is lost forever—even magic can't help them find it."

103
00:05:42.397 --> 00:05:44.598
She changed the subject, pointing upward.

104
00:05:45.618 --> 00:05:47.298
"There's an even better view if you look up."

105
00:05:48.259 --> 00:05:52.200
Far overhead, Mount Mystery stretched toward the sky.

106
00:05:53.204 --> 00:05:56.605
Near the top a fortress loomed out of the craggy rock.

107
00:05:56.625 --> 00:06:00.546
"That's old King Zanta's fortress," Zella said.

108
00:06:00.566 --> 00:06:04.747
"Morb lived there when he was trying to take over Magica."

109
00:06:06.248 --> 00:06:07.008
Raff nodded.

110
00:06:07.028 --> 00:06:10.529
"It was a pretty terrible place even before that.

111
00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.750
King Zanta ruled during the Old Times.

112
00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.511
Back then dark magic was everywhere."

113
00:06:17.531 --> 00:06:19.552
"Yes, I know."

114
00:06:20.436 --> 00:06:23.118
Loro peered up toward the fortress thoughtfully.

115
00:06:23.138 --> 00:06:27.321
"Zanta was the most powerful ruler Magica ever had."

116
00:06:27.341 --> 00:06:29.562
"I suppose so."

117
00:06:30.383 --> 00:06:31.203
Zella frowned.

118
00:06:31.223 --> 00:06:33.245
"But he sounds horrible.

119
00:06:34.045 --> 00:06:37.808
We learned in school that he used otherworld magic to control people."

120
00:06:37.828 --> 00:06:42.711
"That's where Morb got the idea for his evil contraptions," Raff said.

121
00:06:43.792 --> 00:06:46.274
Just then they heard a loud hee-haw.

122
00:06:47.154 --> 00:06:49.556
Zella realized Muncher had wandered off.

123
00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:51.308
"Muncher sounds scared!"

124
00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:54.030
Raff rushed toward the sound.

125
00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:59.052
Zella followed with Loro, and soon they burst into another clearing.

126
00:06:59.072 --> 00:07:00.933
"Oh no!"

127
00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:01.973
Zella cried.

128
00:07:03.234 --> 00:07:07.215
The donkey was struggling to escape from the swirling center of a wormhole!
